    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. it's actually true. my mom has to quit her job to look after me, and my brother can barely see his friends because he's always helping me out. it's like i'm a black hole just sucking all the life out of them. i'm not \"carrying a heavy load,\" i *am* the load.",
